      {
        "id": 6266,
        "name": "logan_mann",
        "username": "logan_mann",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/43a26b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-10T21:41:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Apostate is listed as being affiliated with this group.&nbsp; Many villains have an affiliation but it makes sense for what they are...like the Chairman affiliated to Pike Industries. But The Host is kind of vague.&nbsp; I wonder if this is a villain group that may be built upon or expanded.&nbsp; By not being specific it makes me wonder.</p><p>I haven't recieved the game yet so maybe there is explanation of this term on his cards in his deck, but just looking online it makes me wonder.</p><p>I also hope Matriarchs Undead Poet Society (see her affiliations on her page) eventually has more members cause thats just awesome</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:09.877Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
