        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Apostate is listed as being affiliated with this group.&nbsp; Many villains have an affiliation but it makes sense for what they are...like the Chairman affiliated to Pike Industries. But The Host is kind of vague.&nbsp; I wonder if this is a villain group that may be built upon or expanded.&nbsp; By not being specific it makes me wonder.</p><p>I haven&#39;t recieved the game yet so maybe there is explanation of this term on his cards in his deck, but just looking online it makes me wonder.</p><p>I also hope Matriarchs Undead Poet Society (see her affiliations on her page) eventually has more members cause thats just awesome</p>",
