        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-09-10T21:59:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had assumed the Host affiliation to mean simply an association with the Infernal Host, as in the army of devils and such that opposes heaven in some cosmology or another.&nbsp;</p><p>However, if that is the name of a villain team, that's potentially really cool, too.</p>",
